<title>USA: Uruguay buys spot gasoil from YPF for early May.</title>
<headline>Uruguay buys spot gasoil from YPF for early May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay's state oil company ANCAP bought 30,000 cubic meters (189,000 barrels) of spot gasoil from Argentina's YPF, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The cargo will be delivered in early May.</p>
<p>The price was undisclosed.</p>
<p>ANCAP is expected to hold a tender for one million barrels of crude oil around April 20.</p>
<p>--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
</text>
